      "content": "i dont know if i can just \"be part of the mess\" anymore. i see the look in my partners eyes every day. it's just exhaustion. like they're constantly waiting for the next bad day or the next crisis. if i wasnt here, they wouldn't have to walk on eggshells. they could actually breathe again. it just seems like my being around is the thing stopping them from being happy.",
